        <mxCell id="analytics-list" value="• Payment Status Distribution (by time period)&#xa;• Top Cases by Amount&#xa;• Payment Trends (7d, 30d, 90d, allTime)&#xa;• Aging Buckets (overdue invoice tracking)&#xa;• PTP (Promise to Pay) Invoices&#xa;• Year-over-Year Comparisons&#xa;• Follow-ups Tracking" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
